{"id":"93f2d1f40aee7116","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-measure8-factor-map.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Factor Map","display":"df-zfc-measure8-factor-map — ZFC Measure8 Factor Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-factor-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-factor-map"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-factor-map — ZFC Measure8 Factor Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-factor-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-factor-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-factor-map — ZFC Measure8 Factor Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"549cf65f429db76a\" href=\"?note=549cf65f429db76a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map\">58-df-zfc-meas-measure-preserving-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\">\\((X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\">\\((Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\\)</span> (measure-preserving systems)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:X\\to Y\">\\(\\pi:X\\to Y\\)</span> (factor map candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8FactorMap}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8FactorMap}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\)</span> (measure-preserving map predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}factor\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8FactorMap}_S(\\pi,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S(T,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal A,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S(S,\\nu,\\nu,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal B,Y,Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S(\\pi,\\mu,\\nu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\pi(T(x))=S(\\pi(x)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}factor\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8FactorMap}_S(\\pi,X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,T,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S(T,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal A,X,X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S(S,\\nu,\\nu,\\mathcal B,\\mathcal B,Y,Y)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8MeasurePreservingMap}_S(\\pi,\\mu,\\nu,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,X,Y)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\pi(T(x))=S(\\pi(x)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ergodic-theoretic definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","l